  <datafield tag="520" ind1="0" ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">The artist's book 'La fille du docteur' is a part of Sophie Calle&lt;U+2019&gt;s larger project with the same title that tells the story of a doctor&lt;U+2019&gt;s daughter, a little girl named Sophie, who grows up to become a striptease artist. The book presents photographs of the doctor&lt;U+2019&gt;s daughter performing a striptease in front of an audience. The pictures are juxtaposed with small calling cards from many of the doctor&lt;U+2019&gt;s friends, congratulating him on the birth of his daughter. The cards are in French with an English translation showing through full-page, translucent photographic plates.</subfield>
  </datafield>
